1
00:00:00,268 --> 00:00:02,938
(Raj:)Just straight to,
"Where's the other white guy?"

2
00:00:04,272 --> 00:00:05,522
(Leonard:)I'm sorry.

3
00:00:05,732 --> 00:00:09,732
(Leonard:)So, listen, I heard something about him.
Can you keep it between us?

4
00:00:09,903 --> 00:00:12,443
(Raj:)Ooh, gossip. When I first got here...

5
00:00:12,656 --> 00:00:15,156
...I thought Americans really gossiped
around the water cooler.

6
00:00:15,367 --> 00:00:18,367
I hung out there for a month,
but the only gossip I heard...

7
00:00:18,578 --> 00:00:21,788
(Raj:)...was about some creepy guy
hanging out by the water cooler.

8
00:00:23,667 --> 00:00:25,337
(Leonard:)Bernadette wants to get a prenup.

9
00:00:25,919 --> 00:00:28,339
(Raj:)Oh, that's a shame.
He's gonna be devastated.

10
00:00:28,546 --> 00:00:30,636
(Leonard:)I never know what to do
in these situations.

11
00:00:30,840 --> 00:00:32,840
- Should I give him a heads up?
- Hmm.

12
00:00:33,051 --> 00:00:35,391
I'm gonna give you the advice
I yell at the TV...

13
00:00:35,595 --> 00:00:38,265
(Raj:)...when the Bachelor
is handing out roses.

14
00:00:39,557 --> 00:00:41,307
(Raj:)Follow your heart.

15
00:00:43,186 --> 00:00:44,316
(Howard:)Check it out.

16
00:00:44,521 --> 00:00:49,111
(Howard:)Look at the size of that
Rice Krispie Treat. Same price, ha, ha.

17
00:00:49,317 --> 00:00:51,527
Ahem, hey, Howard,
I need to tell you something.

18
00:00:51,736 --> 00:00:55,196
(Howard:)I know, it's not on my wedding diet.
I don't care.

19
00:00:57,200 --> 00:01:03,410
No. Listen, I heard that Bernadette's thinking
about asking you for a prenup.

